<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= name %> さんの生きた証 - Amber Ink
    </title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --amber-50: #fffbeb;
            --amber-100: #fef3c7;
            --amber-400: #fbbf24;
            --amber-600: #d97706;
            --slate-800: #1e293b;
            --slate-600: #475569;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Hiragino Sans", Meiryo, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffcf0 0%, #fff7e6 100%);
            color: var(--slate-800);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid white;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: var(--slate-800);
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--amber-600);
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber-100);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: var(--slate-600);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .persona-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.05);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--amber-400);
        }

        .interest-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .tag {
            background: var(--amber-100);
            color: var(--amber-600);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .meta {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--slate-600);
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--amber-100);
            padding-top: 30px;
        }

        .amber-note {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--slate-600);
        }

        .glow-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: var(--amber-400);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--amber-400);
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .container {
                box-shadow: none;
                border: none;
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .no-print {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">✨</div>
            <h1>
                <%= name %> 様
            </h1>
            <div class="subtitle">琥珀に刻まれた、生きた証</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2><span class="glow-dot"></span> 趣味と情熱</h2>
            <div class="interest-tags">
                <% interest.split(/[,\s+、]/).filter(t=> t).forEach(function(tag) { %>
                    <span class="tag">
                        <%= tag %>
                    </span>
                    <% }); %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2><span class="glow-dot"></span> 琥珀（Amber）による記録</h2>
            <div class="persona-box">
                <p class="amber-note">「<%= personaSummary %>」</p>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--amber-600); margin-top: 20px; text-align: right;">
                    — 会員様との温かい対話より抽出
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2><span class="glow-dot"></span> 最後の活動記録</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--slate-800);">
                <%= last_seen_formatted %>
            </p>
        </div>

        <% if (jewelryBox) { %>
            <div class="section no-print">
                <h2><span class="glow-dot"></span> 封印された想い（琥珀の宝石箱）</h2>
                <div id="drop-zone" class="persona-box"
                    style="border-left-color: #f59e0b; background: #fffcf0; transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <div id="key-preview-container"
                            style="width: 100px; height: 100px; background: #fef3c7; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px solid #fde68a; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative;">
                            <% if (keyImageBase64) { %>
                                <img id="key-preview-img" src="<%= keyImageBase64 %>"
                                    style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.5; filter: sepia(0.3); transition: all 0.5s ease;">
                                <div id="key-guide-label"
                                    style="position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.6); color: white; font-size: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 2px; transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                                    この画像</div>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <span style="font-size: 40px;">💎</span>
                                    <% } %>
                        </div>
                        <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 250px;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--slate-800);">
                                会員様は大切な想いをこの宝石箱に封印されました。<br>
                                閲覧するには、会員様から託された左の<strong>「鍵画像」</strong>を選択、またはここにドラッグ＆ドロップしてください。
                            </p>
                            <input type="file" id="key-file-input" accept="image/*" style="display: none;">
                            <button onclick="document.getElementById('key-file-input').click()" id="unseal-btn"
                                style="background: #f59e0b; color: white; border: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); transition: all 0.2s ease;">
                                鍵画像を選択して解錠する
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="unseal-result"
                        style="display: none; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px dashed #fde68a;">
                        <div
                            style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <p
                                style="font-size: 12px; color: #d97706; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;">
                                ✨ 封印されていたメッセージ:
                            </p>
                            <button onclick="exportToTxt()"
                                style="background: white; color: var(--amber-600); border: 1px solid var(--amber-400); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;">
                                💾 TXT形式で保存
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="decrypted-content"
                            style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--slate-800); line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap; background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid #fef3c7;">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="unseal-error"
                        style="display: none; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #ef4444; background: #fef2f2; padding: 15px; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid #fee2e2;">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <style>
                #drop-zone.drag-over {
                    background: #fef3c7 !important;
                    border: 2px dashed #f59e0b !important;
                    transform: scale(1.02);
                }

                #key-preview-container:hover #key-preview-img {
                    opacity: 0.8 !important;
                    filter: sepia(0) !important;
                }

                #key-preview-container:hover #key-guide-label {
                    background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.9) !important;
                }

                .unsealed #key-preview-img {
                    opacity: 1 !important;
                    filter: sepia(0) !important;
                    transform: scale(1.1);
                }

                .unsealed #key-guide-label {
                    display: none !important;
                }
            </style>

            <script>
                const MEMORY_BUNDLE = '<%= jewelryBox.memoryBundle %>';
                const USER_NAME = '<%= name %>';
                const ENCRYPTED_AT = '<%= jewelryBox.lastEncryptedAt %>';

                function base64ToArrayBuffer(base64) {
                    const binary_string = window.atob(base64);
                    const len = binary_string.length;
                    const bytes = new Uint8Array(len);
                    for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) {
                        bytes[i] = binary_string.charCodeAt(i);
                    }
                    return bytes.buffer;
                }

                function extractDataFromImage(canvas) {
                    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
                    const imageData = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
                    const pixels = imageData.data;
                    let binaryData = '';
                    const maxBits = 64000;
                    for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(maxBits, pixels.length / 4); i++) {
                        const pixelIndex = i * 4 + 3;
                        binaryData += (pixels[pixelIndex] & 1).toString();
                    }
                    let extractedStr = '';
                    for (let i = 0; i < binaryData.length; i += 8) {
                        const byte = binaryData.slice(i, i + 8);
                        if (byte.length < 8) break;
                        const charCode = parseInt(byte, 2);
                        const char = String.fromCharCode(charCode);
                        extractedStr += char;
                        if (extractedStr.endsWith('###END###')) {
                            return extractedStr.replace('###END###', '');
                        }
                    }
                    return null;
                }

                async function unsealMemory(file) {
                    const resultDiv = document.getElementById('unseal-result');
                    const contentDiv = document.getElementById('decrypted-content');
                    const errorDiv = document.getElementById('unseal-error');
                    const btn = document.getElementById('unseal-btn');

                    resultDiv.style.display = 'none';
                    errorDiv.style.display = 'none';
                    btn.disabled = true;
                    btn.innerText = '解錠中...';

                    try {
                        const img = new Image();
                        img.src = URL.createObjectURL(file);
                        await new Promise((res, rej) => {
                            img.onload = res;
                            img.onerror = rej;
                        });

                        const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
                        canvas.width = img.width;
                        canvas.height = img.height;
                        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
                        ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0);

                        const privateKeyBase64 = extractDataFromImage(canvas);
                        if (!privateKeyBase64) throw new Error("この画像には有効な「鍵」が見つかりませんでした。");

                        const rsaPrivateKey = await window.crypto.subtle.importKey(
                            'pkcs8',
                            base64ToArrayBuffer(privateKeyBase64),
                            { name: 'RSA-OAEP', hash: 'SHA-256' },
                            true,
                            ['unwrapKey']
                        );

                        const parts = MEMORY_BUNDLE.split('.');
                        if (parts.length !== 3) throw new Error("データ形式が正しくありません。");
                        const [ivBase64, wrappedKeyBase64, ciphertextBase64] = parts;

                        const aesKey = await window.crypto.subtle.unwrapKey(
                            'raw',
                            base64ToArrayBuffer(wrappedKeyBase64),
                            rsaPrivateKey,
                            { name: 'RSA-OAEP', hash: 'SHA-256' },
                            { name: 'AES-GCM' },
                            true,
                            ['decrypt']
                        );

                        const decrypted = await window.crypto.subtle.decrypt(
                            { name: 'AES-GCM', iv: base64ToArrayBuffer(ivBase64) },
                            aesKey,
                            base64ToArrayBuffer(ciphertextBase64)
                        );

                        const decoded = new TextDecoder().decode(decrypted);
                        contentDiv.innerText = decoded;
                        resultDiv.style.display = 'block';
                        btn.innerText = '鍵画像を選択する';

                        // 解錠成功時の演出
                        document.getElementById('drop-zone').classList.add('unsealed');
                    } catch (e) {
                        console.error(e);
                        errorDiv.innerText = 'エラー: ' + (e.name === 'OperationError' || e.message.includes('decryption failed') ? '鍵が一致しません。正しい鍵画像を選択しているか確認してください。' : e.message);
                        errorDiv.style.display = 'block';
                        btn.innerText = 'もう一度選択する';
                    } finally {
                        btn.disabled = false;
                    }
                }

                function exportToTxt() {
                    const content = document.getElementById('decrypted-content').innerText;
                    const blob = new Blob([content], { type: 'text/plain' });
                    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
                    const a = document.createElement('a');

                    const shortName = USER_NAME.slice(0, 8);
                    const dateParts = new Date(ENCRYPTED_AT);
                    const dateStr = dateParts.toISOString().split('T')[0];

                    a.href = url;
                    a.download = `AmberInk_${shortName}様_${dateStr}.txt`;
                    document.body.appendChild(a);
                    a.click();
                    document.body.removeChild(a);
                    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
                }

                document.getElementById('key-file-input').onchange = (e) => {
                    if (e.target.files[0]) unsealMemory(e.target.files[0]);
                };

                // ドラッグ＆ドロップの実装
                const dropZone = document.getElementById('drop-zone');

                ['dragover', 'dragenter'].forEach(eventName => {
                    dropZone.addEventListener(eventName, (e) => {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        e.stopPropagation();
                        dropZone.classList.add('drag-over');
                    });
                });

                ['dragleave', 'drop'].forEach(eventName => {
                    dropZone.addEventListener(eventName, (e) => {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        e.stopPropagation();
                        dropZone.classList.remove('drag-over');
                    });
                });

                dropZone.addEventListener('drop', (e) => {
                    const files = e.dataTransfer.files;
                    if (files.length > 0) {
                        unsealMemory(files[0]);
                    }
                });
            </script>
            <% } %>

                <div class="meta">
                    <p>このページは会員様の「輝き」を保存するために生成されました。</p>
                    <p>発行：Amber Ink - 会員様の「生きた証」を大切に。 <%= generated_at %>
                    </p>
                    <p class="no-print" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                        <button onclick="window.print()"
                            style="background: var(--amber-600); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;">
                            PDFとして保存 / 印刷
                        </button>
                    </p>
                </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>